---
// HowItWorks.astro - Step-by-Step Workflow Explanation
---

<section id="how-it-works" class="w-full py-16 md:py-24 px-4 md:px-8 bg-[var(--color-canvas)] border-b border-[var(--color-hairline)] transition-colors">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center mb-16">
      <span class="caption-mono text-[#7928ca] dark:text-[#b87fff] mb-2 font-mono">Simple & Secure Workflow</span>
      <h2 class="display-lg text-[var(--color-ink)] max-w-xl">
        How In-Browser Metadata Removal Works.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-[var(--color-body)] max-w-lg mt-3">
        Our 4-step client-side pipeline runs entirely inside your browser's isolated JavaScript sandbox.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 4-step Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      
      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-[var(--color-canvas-soft-2)] border border-[var(--color-hairline)] flex flex-col justify-between relative group hover:border-[var(--color-hairline-strong)] transition-all">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-primary)] text-[var(--color-on-primary)] text-xs font-mono font-semibold flex items-center justify-center">1</span>
            <span class="caption-mono text-[var(--color-mute)]">LOAD</span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)] mb-2">1. Select Images</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-[var(--color-body)] leading-relaxed">
            Drag and drop images into the browser. File API loads image binary data into RAM without network requests.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-[var(--color-hairline)] text-[11px] font-mono text-[var(--color-mute)]">
          HTML5 File API
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-[var(--color-canvas-soft-2)] border border-[var(--color-hairline)] flex flex-col justify-between relative group hover:border-[var(--color-hairline-strong)] transition-all">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-primary)] text-[var(--color-on-primary)] text-xs font-mono font-semibold flex items-center justify-center">2</span>
            <span class="caption-mono text-[#0070f3]">PARSE</span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)] mb-2">2. Inspect Metadata</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-[var(--color-body)] leading-relaxed">
            `exifr` scans TIFF/EXIF segments, XMP blocks, IPTC metadata, GPS coordinates, and PNG chunk parameters.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-[var(--color-hairline)] text-[11px] font-mono text-[var(--color-mute)]">
          Header Scanning
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-[var(--color-canvas-soft-2)] border border-[var(--color-hairline)] flex flex-col justify-between relative group hover:border-[var(--color-hairline-strong)] transition-all">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-primary)] text-[var(--color-on-primary)] text-xs font-mono font-semibold flex items-center justify-center">3</span>
            <span class="caption-mono text-[#7928ca] dark:text-[#b87fff]">STRIP</span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)] mb-2">3. Canvas Re-render</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-[var(--color-body)] leading-relaxed">
            HTML5 Canvas re-draws pixel data to create a fresh image binary with zero EXIF or AI prompt markers.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-[var(--color-hairline)] text-[11px] font-mono text-[var(--color-mute)]">
          Clean Canvas Export
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 4 -->
      <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-[var(--color-canvas-soft-2)] border border-[var(--color-hairline)] flex flex-col justify-between relative group hover:border-[var(--color-hairline-strong)] transition-all">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-primary)] text-[var(--color-on-primary)] text-xs font-mono font-semibold flex items-center justify-center">4</span>
            <span class="caption-mono text-[#29bc9b]">SAVE</span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)] mb-2">4. Download Clean File</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-[var(--color-body)] leading-relaxed">
            Download your clean images instantly or export all processed files into a single compressed ZIP archive.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-[var(--color-hairline)] text-[11px] font-mono text-[var(--color-mute)]">
          Direct / ZIP Export
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
